[h1]Phobos Manufacturing[/h1]
[b]Version:[/b] 0.0.1
[b]Publication status:[/b] Not published - held scaffold

A research and development scaffold for dedicated machining and finished components in support of longer shipboard habitation.

[h2]Current features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Buildable mod scaffold with Framework integration.
[*]Research and an artwork plan for an enclosed machining centre and heat-sink finishing.
[/list]

[h2]Limits and save behaviour[/h2]
[list]
[*]Held draft: no operational machinery, recipes or merchant stock. Not a playable machining mod yet. The shared installer already supports explicit Manufacturing selection with Framework and normal backup/verification checks; this is delivery support, not completed machinery.
[*]Proposed equipment, tooling, yields and resource budgets remain designs; no gameplay validation is claimed.
[/list]

[h2]Requirements and installation[/h2]
Scaffold baseline: Ostranauts 1.0.1.5, BepInEx 5 and Phobos Framework 0.17.0 or newer. Shipbreaker integrations are optional design work.

This is a maintained pre-publication page draft, not a download announcement. No Workshop item has been published for this draft. Use the installation guide for source/prepared-package availability and loader setup. Do not remove required providers from saves that contain their content.

